#: .\templates\documents\cobertura.html:12
msgid ""
"Before requiring anything, this is what the model already has. A "
"requirement\n"
"  written blind is either one the model already meets — which says nothing — "
"or one it does not\n"
"  meet at all, which gets ignored from day one."
msgstr ""
"Antes de exigir algo, esto es lo que el modelo ya trae. Un requisito escrito "
"a ciegas es o uno que el modelo ya cumple —que no dice nada— o uno que no "
"cumple en absoluto, que se ignora desde el primer día."

